<ac:structured-macro ac:name="info"><ac:parameter ac:name="title">How to maintain this page</ac:parameter><ac:rich-text-body><ul><li>One row per rule in the Rule Register. Rule IDs are never renumbered or reused.</li><li><strong>Current Check</strong>: the command or API the tool runs and the pass condition.</li><li><strong>When the tool's check changes</strong>: move the text from Current Check to Old Check, write the new logic in Current Check, give the reason and date in Comments, and update Last Review.</li><li>To retire a rule, strike through the row and write <code>RETIRED vX.Y</code> in Comments.</li><li>Update the counts in the table above after editing. The overview dashboard reads them.</li></ul></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro>
