<h2>Scope &amp; applicability</h2>
<ul><li>Components: Gaia OS (gateways), Gaia OS (management server), security policy / rulebase, log server</li><li>Data source: <code>clish</code>: <code>show configuration</code>, <code>show password-controls all</code></li><li>Data source: Management API: <code>mgmt_cli show access-rulebase</code> (JSON)</li><li>Data source: Expert mode files where no clish/API equivalent exists</li><li><strong>CP-POL rules</strong> apply to the security policy on the management server, not to individual gateways.</li><li>State in <strong>Comments</strong> when a rule applies only to gateways or only to management servers.</li><li>Note inline layers and shared layers when the rulebase check does not parse them.</li></ul>
